  "id": "intellectual-insight",
  "term": "intellectual insight",
  "definition": "Intellectual insight is an understanding reached at the level of thought or explanation without a matching shift in felt experience or behavior. In this sense, a person can clearly describe what is happening yet remain unchanged emotionally and in action.",
